:: Farm Waterland
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "alex_farm">><<set $bus to "waterland">><<effects>>

You are at the water basins within the farm grounds.
<<if $farm.waterland is 1>>
	Small water basins sit ready to be planted.
<<elseif $farm.waterland is 2>>
	The larger basins have been dammed and are ready to be planted.
<<elseif $farm.waterland is 3>>
	A vast artificial basin network covers the land, ready to be planted.
<</if>>

<<if Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
	Ice covers the basins and renders them unusable.
<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	The icy rain pelts you.
<<else>>
	The chill breeze is lessened here.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $stress gte 10000>>
	<<passoutfarmroad>>
<<elseif $farm_attack_timer is 0 and Time.hour gte 21>>
	<<npc Alex>><<person1>>
	Alex rushes over. <span class="red">"Remy's here,"</span> <<he>> says. "We can do this. Go get ready, I'll
	<<if $farm.tower_guard>>
		check on $farm.tower_guard."
	<<else>>
		see if I can spot them."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<farm_assault_intro>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Prepare|Farm Assault Wardrobe]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
		<span class="red">Both of your arms are bound</span>, so you are unable to farm.
	<<elseif Weather.isFrozen("lake")>>
		<span class="blue">The water basins are frozen over.</span>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<if $waterfarm is undefined>>
			<<set $waterfarm to 1>>
			<<plots_init waterfarm 1 water 1 small>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $farm.waterland gte 2 and $waterfarm is 1>>
			<<set $waterfarm to 2>>
			<<add_plot waterfarm water 2 medium>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $farm.waterland is 3 and $waterfarm is 2>>
			<<set $waterfarm to 3>>
			<<add_plot waterfarm water 3 large>>
		<</if>>
		<<plot_effects>>
		<<display_plot waterfarm>>
	<</if>>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave (0:10)|Farm Work]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>